{
  "name": "ai-todo",
  "type": "registry:ui",
  "title": "AI 任务清单 AI Todo",
  "description": "展示 Agent 计划、执行进度与任务说明。",
  "categories": [
    "ai"
  ],
  "import": "import { AiTodo, AiTodoHeader, AiTodoItem, AiTodoList, aiTodoIndicatorVariants } from \"@/components/ui/ai-todo\"",
  "exports": [
    "AiTodo",
    "AiTodoHeader",
    "AiTodoItem",
    "AiTodoList",
    "aiTodoIndicatorVariants"
  ],
  "typeExports": [
    "AiTodoItemProps",
    "AiTodoStatus"
  ],
  "install": {
    "wui": "pnpm dlx @wui-design/cli@latest add @wui/ai-todo",
    "shadcn": "pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add https://ui.wzx.wang/r/ai-todo.json",
    "npmDependencies": [
      "class-variance-authority",
      "lucide-react"
    ],
    "registryDependencies": [
      "utils"
    ]
  },
  "props": [],
  "events": "为 `AiTodoItem` 传入 `onStatusChange` 后，状态图标会成为可交互按钮，点击时在 `completed` 和 `pending` 之间切换建议状态。\n实际状态仍由调用方控制，回调中的新状态需要写回消息流或后端任务数据；没有回调时，任务项保持只读。",
  "examples": [
    {
      "name": "ai-todo-demo",
      "title": "基础用法"
    }
  ],
  "files": [
    "registry/ui/ai-todo.tsx"
  ],
  "docsUrl": "https://ui.wzx.wang/docs/components/ai-todo",
  "sourceUrl": "https://ui.wzx.wang/r/ai-todo.json"
}
